d","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":4,"sub":2,"text":"Wegen der Krankheit kommt Anna nicht.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"wegen + Genitiv — der Grund","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":4,"sub":3,"text":"Wegen des Verkehrs bin ich zu spät.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"wegen + Genitiv — der Grund","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":4,"sub":4,"text":"Wegen meiner Prüfung lerne ich heute viel.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"wegen + Genitiv — der Grund","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":5,"sub":1,"text":"Trotz des Regens gehen wir spazieren.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"trotz + Genitiv — der unerwartete Gegensatz","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":5,"sub":2,"text":"Trotz der Probleme arbeitet er weiter.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"trotz + Genitiv — der unerwartete Gegensatz","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":5,"sub":3,"text":"Trotz der Müdigkeit lernt sie Deutsch.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"trotz + Genitiv — der unerwartete Gegensatz","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":6,"sub":1,"text":"Während des Unterrichts darf man nicht telefonieren.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"während + Genitiv — währenddessen","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":6,"sub":2,"text":"Während der Reise haben wir viele Fotos gemacht.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"während + Genitiv — währenddessen","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":6,"sub":3,"text":"Während des Essens sprechen wir Deutsch.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"während + Genitiv — währenddessen","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":8,"sub":1,"text":"mit dem Lehrer (Dativ) vs. wegen des Lehrers (Genitiv)","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"Dativ vs. Genitiv","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":8,"sub":2,"text":"für den Lehrer (Akkusativ) vs. trotz des Lehrers (Genitiv)","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"Dativ vs. Genitiv","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"reading","type":"reading-passage","idx":1,"text":"Wegen der hohen Armut entschied sich eine Kaufmannsfamilie eine Sozialsiedlung zu bauen Wegen des katholischen Glaubens der Familie war das Projekt wohltätig ausgerichtet Trotz des niedrigen Stiftungsvermögens konnte die Siedlung gebaut werden Ein Nachtwächter bewachte die Wohnungen während der Nacht Wegen des guten Originalzustands der Gebäude ist die Siedlung heute touristisch interessant","authoredText":"Wegen der hohen Armut entschied sich eine Kaufmannsfamilie, eine Sozialsiedlung zu bauen. Wegen des katholischen Glaubens der Familie war das Projekt wohltätig ausgerichtet. Trotz des niedrigen Stiftungsvermögens konnte die Siedlung gebaut werden. Ein Nachtwächter bewachte die Wohnungen während der Nacht. Wegen des guten Originalzustands der Gebäude ist die Siedlung heute touristisch interessant.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Die Geschichte einer alten Siedlung","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Warum isst du eigentlich schon wieder keinen Käse, Timo?","speaker":"Kerstin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_005_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Wegen meiner Fitness — ich koche diese Woche komplett vegan, trotz meiner großen Liebe zu Camembert.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_005_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Respekt!","speaker":"Kerstin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_005_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Und das schaffst du wirklich, während der ganzen Woche?","speaker":"Kerstin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_005_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Bis jetzt schon — aber frag mich noch mal am Freitagabend.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_005_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Warum isst du eigentlich schon wieder keinen Käse, Timo?","speaker":"Kerstin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_005_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Wegen meiner Fitness — ich koche diese Woche komplett vegan, trotz meiner großen Liebe zu Camembert.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_005_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Respekt! Und das schaffst du wirklich, während der ganzen Woche?","speaker":"Kerstin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_005_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Bis jetzt schon — aber frag mich noch mal am Freitagabend.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_005_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Wegen meiner Gesundheit ernähre ich mich vegetarisch.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Deine Freundin fragt, warum du kein Fleisch mehr isst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Trotz der hohen Preise kaufe ich biologische Nahrungsmittel.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Ein Freund sagt, biologische Nahrungsmittel sind zu teuer. Was machst du trotzdem?","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Während der Diät habe ich vor allem Gemüse gegessen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Deine Mutter fragt, was du während der Diät gegessen hast.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Wegen des vielen Fleisches esse ich dort nicht.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Eine Kollegin fragt, warum du nicht in der Kantine isst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Das ist das Haus meiner Großeltern und der Garten meines Onkels.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Du zeigst Fotos aus deiner Heimat. Erklär, wem was gehört.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":6,"text":"Während der Arbeit esse ich nur einen Salat.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":6,"text":"Ein Freund fragt, wie du dich während der Arbeit ernährst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":7,"text":"Wegen der günstigen Miete wohne ich jetzt in der Siedlung.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-5-genitiv-wegen-trotz-waehrend","level":